    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1039,
      "versionNonce": 171700572,
      "index": "bq7",
      "isDeleted": true,
      "id": "uzA1EZvJxH0-6Izu2_3uH",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 111.71446274552807,
      "y": -677.2630069967738,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 1012.55,
      "height": 990,
      "seed": 934027990,
      "groupIds": [
        "_tq96ZTObxFMK3YpzQdz8",
        "q7EX5s4LT1VBFbv-Cz5Vx",
        "ycTWjcjon_UWZF-1BJ79s"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793704617161,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> The machine learning workflow is a cyclic process with\n    steps :\n\n        ° Get the data\n\n        ° Analyse :\n            - Load\n            - Clean\n            - Explore\n            - Interpret\n            - Refine\n\n        ° Process & Train :\n            - Extract Features\n            - Pre-Process\n            - Train \n            - Evaluate\n            - Refine\n\n        ° Deploy\n\n        ° Predict & Maintain",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> The machine learning workflow is a cyclic process with\n    steps :\n\n        ° Get the data\n\n        ° Analyse :\n            - Load\n            - Clean\n            - Explore\n            - Interpret\n            - Refine\n\n        ° Process & Train :\n            - Extract Features\n            - Pre-Process\n            - Train \n            - Evaluate\n            - Refine\n\n        ° Deploy\n\n        ° Predict & Maintain",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793606637120,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
