      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793704622183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "- Once a model has been finished and has been validated\n  and tested, it is then ready to be pushed into\n  production\n\n- We call this AIOps\n\n- And this is critical to distinguish between MLOps\n- Usually when we talk about MLOps, we're talking\n  about the process of curating data, cleaning it,\n  training that data into a model, and then some\n  form of validation\n\n- We now talk about AIOps, which is when we talk\n  about the inference of the model and all the\n  monitoring and security that needs to go around\n  to protect that model and make sure that it has\n  the appropriate life cycle and can be consumed \n  by outside applications and services",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Once a model has been finished and has been validated\n  and tested, it is then ready to be pushed into\n  production\n\n- We call this AIOps\n\n- And this is critical to distinguish between MLOps\n- Usually when we talk about MLOps, we're talking\n  about the process of curating data, cleaning it,\n  training that data into a model, and then some\n  form of validation\n\n- We now talk about AIOps, which is when we talk\n  about the inference of the model and all the\n  monitoring and security that needs to go around\n  to protect that model and make sure that it has\n  the appropriate life cycle and can be consumed \n  by outside applications and services",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793606649041,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
